"справочника отива директно на фактурата и на митническия опаковъчен лист."
msgstr ""
"What to check: compare the net weight of the codes listed below with the "
"last Excel file you loaded. If a weight does not match, correct it by "
"loading the catalogue again from the file — the weight from the catalogue"
" goes straight onto the invoice and the customs packing list."

